  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tvillinganstalter, Est</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twin prison, Est - Twin prison co-op, Est</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens syfte &#xE4;r att genom att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra det estniska kriminalv&#xE5;rds-systemet anpassa det till de av Europar&#xE5;det fastst&#xE4;llda European Prison Rules. En &#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring av svensk kunskap genom ett samarbete mellan Kriminalv&#xE5;rdsstyrelsen och dess estniska motsvarighet, twinning samarbete mellan olika f&#xE4;ngelser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to support the process of bringing the Estonian prison system into conformity with European standards. This is done bytransfer of know-how through institutional twinning between the Swedish Prison and Probation Administration and the Estonian Correctional Service.</narrative>
  </description>
